{"session":{"id":"d4ca6000-511e-44dd-a753-2f80b4c67730","tenantId":"018f3d00-0000-7000-8000-000000000001","siteId":"01a14000-1000-7000-8000-000000000001","agentDefinitionId":"operations-investigation.v1","createdBy":"01a13920-9822-71ff-af68-023cb79317fe","revision":1,"status":"COMPLETED","activeRunId":null,"createdAt":1792235727811,"updatedAt":1792235736191},"runs":[{"id":"9a1ff50a-ec94-4d5a-9244-53ba46ab4f02","sessionId":"d4ca6000-511e-44dd-a753-2f80b4c67730","modelRef":{"provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-flash"},"status":"COMPLETED","startedAt":1792235727811,"finishedAt":1792235736191,"usage":{"inputTokens":5665,"outputTokens":1311,"modelCalls":3,"toolCalls":3},"failureCode":null}],"messages":[{"id":"0211aee1-3bbf-4826-a7a3-a1b4fbe32fdc","sessionId":"d4ca6000-511e-44dd-a753-2f80b4c67730","runId":null,"role":"OPERATOR","content":"昨天每小时的用电量、供冷量和综合能效，哪几个小时能效最低？","createdAt":1792235727811},{"id":"message-9a1ff50a-ec94-4d5a-9244-53ba46ab4f02-0","sessionId":"d4ca6000-511e-44dd-a753-2f80b4c67730","runId":"9a1ff50a-ec94-4d5a-9244-53ba46ab4f02","role":"ASSISTANT","content":"我会先查询站点背景信息，然后拉取昨天的数据。","createdAt":1792235728271},{"id":"message-9a1ff50a-ec94-4d5a-9244-53ba46ab4f02-1","sessionId":"d4ca6000-511e-44dd-a753-2f80b4c67730","runId":"9a1ff50a-ec94-4d5a-9244-53ba46ab4f02","role":"ASSISTANT","content":"站点是松雅轩，时区为 Asia/Shanghai，因此“昨天”是 2026-10-16（本地时间 00:00–24:00），在 UTC 中是 2026-10-15T16:00Z 到 2026-10-16T16:00Z。","createdAt":1792235729655},{"id":"message-9a1ff50a-ec94-4d5a-9244-53ba46ab4f02-2","sessionId":"d4ca6000-511e-44dd-a753-2f80b4c67730","runId":"9a1ff50a-ec94-4d5a-9244-53ba46ab4f02","role":"ASSISTANT","content":"昨天（10/16）能效最低的是 **07:00（约3.52）和16:00（约3.75）**，明显低于白天稳定段的4.6～5.0；另外 14:00、15:00 完全没有供冷，能效为0。\n\n**能效最低的几个小时（按时间顺序）**\n\n| 时段 | 用电量 | 供冷量 | 综合能效 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 07:00 | 109 kWh | 383 kWh | 3.52 |\n| 16:00 | 85 kWh | 319 kWh | 3.75 |\n| 08:00 | 110 kWh | 510 kWh | 4.64 |\n| 10:00 | 104 kWh | 486 kWh | 4.68 |\n| 18:00 | 227 kWh | 1062 kWh | 4.68 |\n\n**依据与看点**\n- 全天机房明显运行时段是 07:00–13:00 和 16:00–20:00，能效多在 4.6～5.0，12:00 最高（4.96）。\n- 07:00 和 16:00 处于启机或负荷爬升阶段：07:00 用电109 kWh但只送出383 kWh冷量，16:00 用电85 kWh对应319 kWh冷量，说明系统刚启动时整体效率偏低。\n- 14:00、15:00 用电只有1 kWh、供冷为0，能效显示0；这属于停机状态，并不是真的能效差，不该拿来跟运行时段比较。\n- 01:00、02:00、04:00、06:00、22:00、23:00 也基本处于待机状态（用电0～2 kWh、无供冷），同样不代表能效问题。\n\n**局限**\n- 以上是按小时的站点级汇总（站点总表口径），不是单机数据，所以还看不出是哪台机组或水泵拖低了能效；可疑或无效的计量区间未纳入。\n- 电费、设备分项本次没查，若需要定位具体设备，需要再按设备拆开看。","createdAt":1792235731063}],"toolExecutions":[{"id":"call_00_fAIf2toeMq19UpzlQSfo2825","sessionId":"d4ca6000-511e-44dd-a753-2f80b4c67730","runId":"9a1ff50a-ec94-4d5a-9244-53ba46ab4f02","toolName":"site_get_context","argumentsDigest":"44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a","status":"COMPLETED","startedAt":1792235729503,"finishedAt":1792235729652,"resultSummary":"Tool completed.","provenance":[],"failureCode":null},{"id":"call_00_7aLzaR8h6ms2NzGFSH7a8285","sessionId":"d4ca6000-511e-44dd-a753-2f80b4c67730","runId":"9a1ff50a-ec94-4d5a-9244-53ba46ab4f02","toolName":"energy_semantic_query","argumentsDigest":"8034ce92f230a146360741e583e621b8b1e79caf94e93889a8252f47d571fa7a","status":"COMPLETED","startedAt":1792235730722,"finishedAt":1792235731059,"resultSummary":"Tool completed.","provenance":[],"failureCode":null},{"id":"call_00_HvacwlxPkjcmU24tmZx25869","sessionId":"d4ca6000-511e-44dd-a753-2f80b4c67730","runId":"9a1ff50a-ec94-4d5a-9244-53ba46ab4f02","toolName":"investigation_complete","argumentsDigest":"9ca322827612d7a8d07a3d04a98945520815b2fb3824fcb99e981865af5af5a7","status":"COMPLETED","startedAt":1792235736183,"finishedAt":1792235736191,"resultSummary":"Tool completed.","provenance":[{"owner":"REGISTRY","resourceId":"01a14000-1000-7000-8000-000000000001","resourceType":"site","toolExecutionId":"call_00_fAIf2toeMq19UpzlQSfo2825"},{"owner":"ENERGY","resourceId":"01a14000-1000-7000-8000-000000000001:2026-10-15T16:00:00Z/2026-10-16T16:00:00Z","resourceType":"site_energy_hourly","toolExecutionId":"call_00_7aLzaR8h6ms2NzGFSH7a8285"}],"failureCode":null}],"artifacts":[{"id":"artifact-call_00_HvacwlxPkjcmU24tmZx25869","kind":"FINDING","runId":"9a1ff50a-ec94-4d5a-9244-53ba46ab4f02","finding":{"outcome":"SUPPORTED_FINDING","summary":"昨天（10/16）能效最低的是07:00（约3.52）和16:00（约3.75），都出现在启机或负荷爬升阶段；其余运行时段多在4.6～5.0。14:00、15:00及夜间多个小时处于停机或待机状态，能效为0，不属于能效问题。","keyFigures":[{"label":"07:00综合能效","value":"3.52"},{"label":"16:00综合能效","value":"3.75"},{"unit":"kWh","label":"07:00用电/供冷","value":"109/383"},{"unit":"kWh","label":"16:00用电/供冷","value":"85/319"}],"limitations":["数据为站点总表口径的小时汇总，无法定位具体是哪台机组或水泵导致能效偏低","14:00、15:00及夜间部分时段供冷为0、用电1～2 kWh，属停机待机状态，能效0不宜与运行时段比较","本次未查设备分项用电和电费，未判断负荷变化与能效退化的具体成因"],"evidenceRefs":[{"owner":"REGISTRY","resourceId":"01a14000-1000-7000-8000-000000000001","resourceType":"site","toolExecutionId":"call_00_fAIf2toeMq19UpzlQSfo2825"},{"owner":"ENERGY","resourceId":"01a14000-1000-7000-8000-000000000001:2026-10-15T16:00:00Z/2026-10-16T16:00:00Z","resourceType":"site_energy_hourly","toolExecutionId":"call_00_7aLzaR8h6ms2NzGFSH7a8285"}],"recommendedNext":["07:00这一小时是哪台机组或水泵用电最多、供冷偏少？","昨天16:00启动阶段的设备运行状态和进出口温差是多少？","昨天各电价时段的电费大约是多少？"]},"createdAt":1792235736191,"sessionId":"d4ca6000-511e-44dd-a753-2f80b4c67730"}]}
